<p id="pack_status" class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-zinc-950 p-5 text-sm/6 text-zinc-700" data-pack-status>
  <% if hand.complete? %>
    <strong class="text-zinc-950">That's your five.</strong>
  <% else %>
    <strong class="text-zinc-950"><%= hand.kept.size %> of <%= hand.pack.size %> picked.</strong>
  <% end %>
  Tap a card to keep it. You can change any pick until the deadline,
  <strong class="text-zinc-950"><%= gameweek.start_time.in_time_zone("London").strftime("%a %-d %b, %H:%M") %></strong>.
</p>
